cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "rdf-augmenter: Ontology-Aware Augmentation of RDF Knowledge Graphs"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated article below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jorge
    family-names: Martinez-Gil
    email: jorgemarcc@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/jorge-martinez-gil/rdf-augmenter"
url: "https://github.com/jorge-martinez-gil/rdf-augmenter"
abstract: >-
  rdf-augmenter is an open toolkit for augmenting RDF knowledge graphs with
  semantically related terms (synonyms, hypernyms, and related concepts) under
  pluggable backends, with reproducibility seeds, W3C PROV-O provenance, and
  SHACL-ready output. It is designed as research infrastructure for the
  Semantic Web and knowledge-graph community.
keywords:
  - RDF
  - knowledge graph augmentation
  - RDF data augmentation
  - ontology-aware augmentation
  - graph completion
  - semantic web
  - SKOS
  - SHACL
